    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ask for a review once when a job is closed in Google Sheets with Gmail\n\nFor service businesses that keep quotes in a Google Sheet and want one review request per finished job, never a reminder.\n\n### How it works\n1. Every day at 10:00 the workflow looks for rows with a date in `closed_at` and no review asked yet.\n2. It sends one email to the customer, in the thread of their quote when `thread_id` is filled, as a new email if not.\n3. It writes `review_asked` and the date in `reply_label`. That row is never asked again.\n\nRows with status `lost` or `no_reply` are skipped, and so are rows whose `job_start` is still in the future.\n\n### Setup\n1. Use the sheet described in the **Sheet** note.\n2. Pick your Google Sheets credential and paste your sheet URL in **Document** in **Read the sheet**, **Mark as asked** and **Mark send failed**. Pick your Gmail credential in the two HTTP nodes and in **Tell the owner it failed**.\n3. Edit **Settings**: `business_name`, `owner_email` and `review_link` first. Nothing is sent while they have the default values.\n4. Set Workflow settings > Timezone to the zone in `timezone`. Activate.\n5. By hand, when a job is done, put a date like 2026-10-14 in `closed_at`.\n\nIf nothing happens, check **Executions**.\n\n### Requirements\n- Google Sheets and Gmail credentials in n8n: docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/google/. If your Google Cloud app is External and in Testing, the connection expires after 7 days; publish it to avoid this.\n- Do not run it next to the weekly summary template: that one also fills `closed_at`.\n\nOur paid template follows up Gmail quotes until the customer replies: https://payhip.com/b/OyN5V\n\nOne person is behind Small Hours. AI agents built and tested this template.",
        "height": 1080,
        "width": 520
      },
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -340,
        -260
      ],
      "id": "cafee99b-b3ee-44e8-8643-cfab4b06c351"
